ros-jazzy-easynav-diagnostic-recovery (0.5.0-1bookworm) bookworm; urgency=high

  * First release: DiagnosticRecoveryManager, a recovery manager driven by diagnostics, with evaluators, mitigations and real-time safety reflexes
  * Safety channel evaluator
  * The collision reflex fails safe without data
  * Rejected reconfigurations are handled
  * Each evaluator reports whether it keeps its frequency
  * Builds on Humble, Jazzy, Kilted, Lyrical and Rolling
  * Contributors: Francisco Martín Rico

